# TemperatureActual is converted to real degrees Celsius by the driver, so
# ADBase.template's EGU="C" is correct and only PREC is adjusted here.
#
# The camera does NOT report Celsius: tempTask() applies this unit's factory
# calibration, Tsensor(C) = 1.7 x raw + 15, from the AXIS test report p10 for
# detector s/n 702 / board KBSG09024003 -- which is this unit. The constants are
# per-unit and live in axisSXR40.cpp as AXIS_TEMP_CAL_SLOPE/OFFSET; if the camera is
# swapped they must be re-established. Raw values outside the fitted range
# (-25..+5) log a one-shot warning because the conversion is then extrapolated.
#
# Temperature and Temperature_RBV are the SETPOINT, which uses an entirely different
# scale: [0, 100] with 0 = -50 C, handled by writeFloat64 adding 50.
record(ai, "$(P)$(R)TemperatureActual")
{
   field(PREC, "2")
}

